  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 513.54 Superior Court Plate",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.54 Superior Court Plate.\n\n(a) Superior court plates shall, upon request to the commissioner’s office, be issued to one vehicle owned by each active member of the New Hampshire superior court pursuant to RSA 261:91.\n\n(b) Superior court plates shall:\n\n(1) Have one or 2 numerals;\n\n(2) Have the words \"SUPERIOR COURT\" on the left vertical border; and\n\n(3) Be distributed in ascending order pursuant to the appointment date of each justice.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; renumbered by #12914 (formerly Saf-C 514.53); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.53)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
